// RA5 fixture: the arsenal of the RA4 fixture (below), in which the vault is an ore purifier and
// the militia a spy, so that the rules those two read can be tested (invariant I10).
//
// RA4 fixture (the RA3 fixture's arsenal with the traits of schema version 5, docs/DECISIONS.md
// R46): the tank is trainable with every ability a rank grants in the shipped data (veteran:
// stronger, firepower, rof, sight, faster; elite: self_heal and three of them again), the heavy
// with firepower as a veteran and stronger at elite rank, the rifleman with faster and
// self_heal, the raider, the roller, the mortar, the boat and the gunship with no ability; the
// conscript and every type not named here are not trainable.
// The two base units, the yards, the barracks, the factories and the airfield are crewed; the
// seer heals itself. The striker has two volleys and needs one of the two docks of an
// airfield; the gunship needs none. The launcher spawns one rocket (a missile), the carrier
// three drones, and the boat one hunter with its secondary weapon; the boat has sensors of 5
// cells, the sub and the squid are cloakable with sensors of 2. Fixture data (invariant I10).
